# Line endings. Text files are stored with LF in the object database and
# checked out with LF on every platform: every tracked text file is already
# LF, so this normalises nothing today, but it stops a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true from committing CRLF-flipped files back, and eol=lf
# overrides that setting for this tree on checkout. The vendored Dear ImGui
# subtree carries its own .gitattributes, which wins inside it; the two
# submodules are governed by their own repositories - see "Known traps" in
# docs/BUILDING.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never treat these as text, whatever the heuristics say.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.bin binary
*.ttf binary
*.lib binary
*.dll binary
*.o binary
*.obj binary
